\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af43 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid4784754 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 WS_Solar}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
 is an app that was developed as part of a suite of tools with an app called WSPR Scheduler. WSPR (Weak Signal Propagation Reporter) is a digital radio transmission mode designed to test and study radio propagation using extremely weak signals, operating 
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
within amateur radio bands from LF through to SHF. It transmits narrow band signals using low power in two-minute timeslots. Receiving stations then decode the transmissions and upload them to the Internet and the results are made available for anyone to 
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 do\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
wnload. WSPR Scheduler was developed to enable the scheduling of these transmissions and to allow seamless band and antenna switching. It also decodes received signals and uploads them to the Internet. A separate app (WSPR Scheduler Live) downloads report
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ed transmission from the Internet to display the results. WSPR Scheduler Map then displays the results on a World map. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 WSPR was originally designed to investigate radio propagation }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8738514 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 and }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
the primary driver of propagation conditions is the Sun. Therefore, in order to be able to predict propagation conditions it is necessary to study what the Sun is doing based on historical and current data.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
Therefore, WSPR Solar retrieves solar geomagnetic data from NOAA in Boulder, Colorado and its two GOES satellites. It can also display a daily propagation forecast. This data is stored and displayed for current and future recording of propagation informat
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ion.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid4784754 
